WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.940
<i>We'll be in first place when the power comes back-pri!</i>

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.190
<i>Hurry up! Kyupikon, Kyupikon!</i>

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.320
Sophie was hiding a secret like that all along...

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:20.760
So basically, the useless Sophie just eats a pickled plum...

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:26.250
and instantly pulls herself together, becoming the cool Sophie.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.050
I really can't keep up with those genius types.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.510
But her on-stage talent is the real deal-pri.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.470
Yeah! I knew you'd get it!

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.950
And Kuma!

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:40.420
Kuma?

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.600
Sophie isn't useless!

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.190
She's a really wonderful person!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:48.710
Hey! I'm the number one scout in all PriPara! That's <i>Mr.</i> Kuma to you! Who do you think you are, missy?

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:49.570
Are you kidding me?

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.460
Well that's what you are now.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.310
Fine then, you're just "La" then! La! Just a single La-kuma!

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.190
Well, you're just "Ku" then!

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:57.140
Hey! Cut it out! Both of you!

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:02.860
<i>How would you like to keep singing as part of the same team from now on, Sophie?</i>

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:04.720
<i>Hey, don't get too pushy now!</i>

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.370
<i>Uh, sorry...</i>

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.790
<i>I'd love to.</i>

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.480
<i>Really?</i>

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.810
<i>Thank you so much!</i>

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:21.570
I did it on my own.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.380
I'm sure I can...

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.990
do stuff on my own now.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.640
Morning!

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:15.580
Clear autumn skies and PriTicket hunting!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:19.780
The second term has begun!

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.300
My little Rina is excited for the autumn too!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.190
Good morning, Headmistress.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.020
Clear autumn skies with no friends in sight!

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.230
So then I...

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.980
Good morning!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.440
G-Good morning!

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.770
So, while visiting your home...

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:44.620
Papa's Pasta's pasta absolutely stole my heart!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:50.200
The fragrance of that pastry board, the richness of the cheese, I am a prisoner to them!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:55.290
And oh, how I wish to sleep on a bed of Papa's Pizza!

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:59.840
But this and that are different matters!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.300
Hand them over!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.880
Uhh... hand what over?

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.720
The PriTickets!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.540
I can smell them!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:13.140
I... I don't have any! Why would I have PriTickets?

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.690
<i>But she totally does have some today...</i>

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.400
You will show me the contents of that bag!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:18.860
Get on with it! Show it to me! Hand it over!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.710
<i>Guess I gotta bail her out.</i>
Get on with it! Show it to me! Hand it over!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.160
Hey! What's a PriTicket doing over there?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.580
Come on, Rina! Where is it? Where?

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.000
Where? Where? Where is it?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.790
Oh, I'm sorry! It was just a cloud!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.290
I'm going ahead. I've got cleanup duty today!

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.240
What a troublemaker. Now, hand over that bag!

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:37.770
Here!

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.710
Hmph. You may go.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:44.800
Capisce!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:47.200
Sorry I kept you waiting, Nao!

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.930
One of these days...

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.660
I'll have you dead to rights!

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:02.460
PriPara Change Complete!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:09.990
Whu-huh? Sophie actually agreed to team up with you?

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.440
That's right-pri!

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:12.990
Seriously? Kuma!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.390
Seriously!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.840
Sophie, the renowned genius who's a whole class above you-kuma?

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.230
She really did-pri!
She really did!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.680
Didn't she?

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.460
I get it-kuma, but still...

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:26.930
If you're worried about her weak constitution, don't be! I'll be there to help!

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.060
As will I.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:33.880
Not to mention, Sophie's inclusion would multiply our team's power by 2.97 pri!

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.390
This is a huge chance-pri!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:40.230
Of course, having a genius like Sophie on our team would be a dream come true.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.820
But don't forget.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.860
He's part of the package too-kumamimumemo!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.070
Kuma...

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:52.500
To begin with, Usagi agreeing to team up with you two

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.250
don't seem too likely to me-kuma!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.460
That jerk's bad news,

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.920
but you two are finally getting into it,

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.630
so I don't wanna rain on your parade-kuma.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.340
Kuma! That's it-kuma!

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.580
I have a condition for allowing a team-up between you and Sophie!

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:10.460
Condition?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.050
Pri?

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:15.640
In PriPara "team" is an important, heavy, and seriously important word-kuma!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:19.190
Once a team is formed, backing out is no little thing-kuma!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.380
If it turned out you and Sophie don't work out <i>after</i> the formation of the team,

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.900
we'd have a team breakup on our hands-kuma!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.030
Seriously!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.510
Team breakup!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:30.740
That'd be bad-pri!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.540
That'd be bad-kuma!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:37.270
So to prevent that, you must prove me you can really make it work with Sophie-kuma!

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:41.710
Only then will you have my managerial permission to team up with Sophie.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.650
Gotcha!
Capisce!

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:47.170
So what do we do-pri?

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.590
There's another event coming up tomorrow.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:55.820
"Flutter! Autumn Color Girls Live" sponsored by the big cosmetics company ParaBou-kuma.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:07:01.810
The winners get to act as the image girls of ParaBou's new line of Autumn-themed lipsticks-kuma!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.360
Gimme a "yahoo!"

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.820
Image Girl? That's so great!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.800
Winning this would be great publicity.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.280
A good chance to prove you could handle teaming up with Sophie!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.700
We're winning for sure-pri!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.060
Okay-kuma. But in return...

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:20.600
If you can't win, you're teaming up with whoever I see fit-kuma!

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.630
Okay!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:22.210
Pri!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.820
I got them all fired up,

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.700
wrapped around my paw-kuma.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.880
Fear my powers of kumanipulation-kuma kumakuma!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:35.750
Right. You two go off and figure out your outfits for the show.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.150
I'm busy preparing for hibernation right now.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.400
You're gonna hibernate?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.420
Of course a bear would hibernate in the winter-kuma.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:44.680
Like a log. It's clear autumn skies and sleeping bears all around.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.730
He sure seems to be enjoying autumn.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.310
Oh! How about we go enjoy autumn too?

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:56.330
Enjoy-pri?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.970
I bet we'll get great outfit ideas!

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:25.550
These are great!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:37.110
Has the autumn enjoyment sparked any good ideas yet?

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.700
The show's this evening.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:42.700
Still nothing. How about you?

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.080
I'm still processing.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.780
So you've got nothing too.

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:52.680
What do we do? We have to win so we can sing with Sophie!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:55.470
Processing! I said I'm processing, so it's just a matter of time!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.140
Lala! Mireille!

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.600
Oh, Eiko!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.980
Hello!

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:06.810
Huh? Isn't that...

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.530
Your opponent from that big game?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.340
Y-You're friends with Eiko?

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.490
Yeah, I guess so.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:21.450
H-Hello, I'm Tochiotome Love, over from Pararis Girls school.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:35.800
After the match, me and Tochiotome....

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.730
<i>That was a good game. You're a heck of a player.</i>

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.260
<i>But I won't make the next one so easy on you, Eiko.</i>

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.500
<i>Yeah! That was a really good game. Thanks, Love!</i>

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:54.650
So we kind of became friends, and were just doing some training together.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:58.110
A good rival is just what you need to keep you motivated.

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:01.200
And Love's Lovely Smash is really amazing.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.750
No one can stop that one.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.290
You're exaggerating.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.660
She seemed really scary during the match...

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.000
But that's not what she's really like at all.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.000
She's actually really cute!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:18.510
C-Cute? No, no, I'm not like that at all!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.010
Not at all!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.220
Love - 15!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.520
L-Love - 15?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:28.190
Sometimes she'll blow a fuse and has to work it out with practice swings. Don't worry about it.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:31.740
She's like a different person on and off the court.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:34.400
But actually, this is great timing!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.260
We were just talking about how she's never gone to PriPara before.

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.770
What? Not even once?

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.610
She's had a ticket arrive by now, right?

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:48.290
I mean I've just always been so tall, and had such broad shoulders...

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:52.520
I'd just feel like an outsider in PriPara!

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.500
Love game!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.810
I'm thinking you'd be just the person to give her that final push, Lala.

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:00.600
Convince her that she'd do fine in PriPara.

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:05.500
Easy peasy! Capisce!

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:08.310
It'll be fine!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:14.640
My mom was always really annoyed by my loud voice, but that changed after I went to PriPara.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.650
There's nothing wrong with being loud!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.820
Changed?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.070
That's right. Everyone can change.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:23.820
Eiko even said she liked my singing,

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.490
and everyone listened to me.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.450
It made me really happy.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.600
Okay! Let's go! To PriPara!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:31.830
You mean right now?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.540
To PriPara! HurryPara!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.300
L-Love - 30!

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:41.470
I-I'm going to PriPara...

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.260
It's going to be fine!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.430
Come on then!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.630
Hey, Miss Meganee!

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:46.390
Yes?

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.910
Love here is making her PriPara debut today!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.470
Please pick her a good outfit like you did for me!

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:53.620
P-Please do!

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.730
Very well.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.080
You have such lovely proportions.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:01.720
Huh?

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:08.540
I think the cool brand, Holic Trick would be a perfect fit for you.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.080
I've registered your default stage outfit.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.250
Now, to the Shop Gate.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.290
O-Okay.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:15.670
Good luck!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:16.750
You've got this.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.000
Think of it as a match!

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:30.560
That's...

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:34.760
That's really me?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.660
Wow!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.950
Love, you look fabulous!

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:40.240
Cool beauty-pri!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.240
As expected of my rival!

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:46.050
Like a supermodel! Absolutely fabulous!

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.570
Th-This is...

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.160
It's what?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.410
L-Love...

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:51.680
Love?

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:52.640
Love - 30?

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:53.580
Love - 40?

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:57.130
Lovely! So cool and lovely!

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.340
Cool Lovely!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.050
Incredible! I feel reborn!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.760
You can be cute even if you're tall!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:07.720
Every girl can be cute!

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.420
Yes! I feel a bit...

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.080
Huah! I feel confident!

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.600
Eeek! So fabulous!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.620
She's so tall! So stylish!

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.150
Cool, but still lovely!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.200
She looks like a model!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.110
Th-Thank you.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.540
What's your name?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.830
Tochiotome Love—or wait, now I'm...

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:32.790
Tochiotome Cool Lovely!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.450
Cool Lovely!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.500
That's so cool!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.960
What are you loitering around for-kuma?

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.140
You got those outfits figured out-kuma?

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:46.180
The outfits.... Wow! So lovely-kuma!

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.200
Was she always an idol around here? Cool, yet lovely.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.640
This is just too good to be true!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.380
9 heads? No, she's 10 heads tall-kuma!

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:54.730
She's dynamite-kuma!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:59.400
You! How'd you like to spend the winter in my cave-kuma?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.640
There he goes again-pri...

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:03.700
What's your name, gorgeous?

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.070
Lo...

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:06.280
Lo?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.490
L-Love...

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.700
Love?

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.560
She's nearing her limit.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.410
Yep.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.700
Lovely Smash!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.520
Th-There it is!

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:25.340
Love's special move as the Pararis Girls School Tennis Club's Captain: "Lovely Smash!"

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.090
Cool Lovely!

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:31.640
Oh! I'm so sorry. Are you okay?

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:34.560
N-Not okay-kuma...

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.400
Your face looks like a maple leaf!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.810
It's a good autumn look for you.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:39.530
Maple leaf...

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:41.050
Good look for autumn...

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:43.000
Every girl can change...

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.530
That's it-pri!
That's it!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:45.550
Thanks, Love!
That's it!

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:47.220
Thanks, Love!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:49.120
You gave us just the jolt we needed to come up with the right outfits!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.400
Just as my calculations said-pri!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:51.220
Kuma?

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.200
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:00.160
You may also scan any Friend Tickets you've received.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.330
Coord Change Start!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:11.890
So Lala and Mireille's autumn coord will be the Autumn Leaf Coord, with a distinctive maple motif.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.440
Autumn Leaf

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.560
Pink Dress

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.600
Chestnut Dress! Pri!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:21.230
What a fun collection of autumn themed imagery!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.760
Fabulous!

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:43.420
Lovely!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.050
Yeah, this is good! We've basically won already!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:05.190
Everyone can change, like an autumn leaf.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.120
I'm... going to change too.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.850
Making Drama Switch On!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:36.930
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:40.740
Cyalume Change!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.350
I can do this.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.260
I can make it to PriPara

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.380
on my own.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.810
Didn't that girl look just like that idol, Houjou Sophie?

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:31.340
Maybe she's cosplaying Sophie?

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:35.930
Hey, you gotta be more careful.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.600
We have a sighting in the east!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:53.070
Pshu...

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.310
We have identified Lady Sophie's voice pattern in the following location!

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.710
Check your GPS!

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:01.990
Affirmative-chanko!

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.610
Squad 3, move in!

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:04.220
Roger!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.910
Why would she leave on her own?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.120
That's so reckless-chanko...

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:11.630
This is completely unprecedented.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.030
That was a great show!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.720
Winners: Lala and Mireille!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.150
Thanks!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:29.140
And our winners are: Lala and Mireille!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:34.820
They will be acting as the image girls for ParaBou's new line of Autumn lipsticks!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:37.540
Gotcha!

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:38.190
Capisce!

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:41.660
Thank you, everyone!

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:46.380
What? You tried to get to PriPara on your own?

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:49.940
You wanted to do something on your own?

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:54.160
Sophie, you just have to do what we say-usa!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.250
Everything has always gone perfectly like that-usa!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.090
Are you dissatisfied with my results-usa? Sophie—

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.390
Let's just give her some space for now.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:00.520
Usa...

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:05.180
Oh, that's right.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:10.510
We already picked your teammates for the Sparkling Future Idol Live-usa.

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:11.890
I'll introduce them to you soon-usa.

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:17.890
Let's give her some space for now-usa.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:18.780
Yes sir!

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:25.650
<i>What's gotten into her? Pretty cosmic weird.</i>

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.410
Pickled plums!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:32.120
We won that event! And we come bearing this box of assorted fine plum pickles.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.620
We couldn't be more ready!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.480
Time to make this official-pri!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:39.960
Clear autumn skies, and Sophie in our team-pri!

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:44.590
Yes?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:49.220
Sophie! Please accept our humble gift of assorted pickled plums.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.440
We're here to make our request official.

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:55.060
Please join our team and sing together with us.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.150
What?

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.600
The pickled... Uh...

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.420
I'm sorry.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:10.720
Huh...

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:13.750
Huuuh?

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.710
This ain't like you said-kuma!

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:18.360
Wh-What's going on?

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:25.260
The Friend Ticket I gave Sophie...

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:29.470
My calculations... were totally off-pri?

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:34.940
Like a bolt of lightning out of the clear autumn skies. Pri...

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:06.900
I'm sorry.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:08.700
Why, Sophie?

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:10.240
I guess we have to give up on her-pri.

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:13.830
Let's just switch gears and look for someone else for our third member!

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:18.440
Oh yeah! Maybe if I get my rank higher we'll get close enough to Sophie!

00:23:18.440 --> 00:23:21.330
But raising your rank isn't that easy-pri!

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:24.990
I'll just queue up a bunch of solo shows every day!

00:23:24.990 --> 00:23:26.630
I'm aiming for Debut Class!

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:29.290
Lala! Don't overdo it-pri!

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:32.440
Next time: What to do? How to deal!? Third Member!!!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:35.490
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
